    {
      "id": 86758,
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Find and defeat the crocolisk Daggerfang and bring back Marek's knife.",
      "englishSHA256": "12b14868d0b68758adf173c60fd9be2155dd198375a0d861f8f292030473d43c"
    },
    {
      "id": 86758,
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "How goes the huntin'?",
      "englishSHA256": "bc8f76b0dbbab16dfb70ba7451fe6e2a0ed5d4014fc9b26baf2c546eb7ae3064"
    },
    {
      "id": 86758,
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Hah! You did it! I never thought that ol' croc would get its comeuppance, but that does the trick!\n\nOh ah... y'know, I had to get me another knife, but maybe that one will bring you some good luck. Why don't you hang onto it?",
      "englishSHA256": "b92b8f14122687fa83472f2de1b6e4b438d5e66094d94e6f73f57739f08ec485"
    },
    {
      "id": 86758,
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "Did I ever tell you how I almost lost me hand to a crocolisk? Managed to jam me knife into its jaw, and scrambled out real quick. I thought I had the knife around here somewhere, but I can't seem to find it.\n\nAnyway, that croc is probably still out there hunting along the edge of the lake. That nasty brute probably needs to go, for the safety of the other hunters, if nothing else.\n\nI've taken to calling it Daggerfang. If you see it, give it a friendly hello from me! And by \"hello\" I mean \"stab.\"",
      "englishSHA256": "790fa512e72ae8b2c7353ceb1be0537641e9e0d1a35059b3b55c9b43d8b3f972"
    }
  ],
